  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.03 Applicant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.03 “Applicant” means a person applying for a property tax credit, exemption, or deferral.\n\nSource. #2080, eff 7-5-82; ss by #2821, eff 8-17-84; ss by #4511, eff 10-26-88; ss by #5911, eff 10-14-94; ss and moved by #7410, eff 11-23-00 (from Rev 401.04); (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08 (from Rev 401.03); ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16",
